                    <h2>Excellence Meets Affordability</h2>
                    <p>For more than 60 years Atlantic Cape Community College has been offering the residents of Atlantic and Cape May counties access to an affordable, comprehensive and convenient higher education close to home.&#160;At Atlantic Cape, you can earn your degree without high student loan debt by saving more than 60% on tuition costs compared to a typical four-year institution of higher learning. With 47 undergraduate degree programs, and 32 certificate and professional series programs available, Atlantic Cape offers numerous academic pathways that will help guide you towards the career that you have always been dreaming of.</p>
